{"info": {"author": null, "author_email": null, "bugtrack_url": null, "classifiers": ["Development Status :: 5 - Production/Stable", "Environment :: Console", "Environment :: MacOS X", "Intended Audience :: Developers", "Intended Audience :: Information Technology", "Intended Audience :: System Administrators", "Operating System :: POSIX :: Linux", "Operating System :: Unix", "Programming Language :: Python", "Programming Language :: Python :: 3", "Programming Language :: Python :: 3 :: Only", "Programming Language :: Python :: 3.11", "Programming Language :: Python :: 3.12", "Topic :: Software Development"], "description": "<!-- PyPI long description. Keep concise, feature-discovery-first. -->\n\n# DataHub Airflow Plugin\n\n**Automatic lineage and run metadata from Apache Airflow into DataHub** \u2014 captures DAG structure, task inputs/outputs, and run history with no manual instrumentation.\n\n## What you can do\n\n- **Capture pipeline lineage** \u2014 automatically extract dataset-level and column-level lineage from SQL operators\n- **Track run history** \u2014 record task execution status, duration, and failures in DataHub\n- **Enhance OpenLineage** \u2014 patches Airflow's OpenLineage extractors with DataHub's advanced SQL parser for richer lineage\n- **Support multiple emitters** \u2014 send metadata via REST, Kafka, or file\n\n## Version compatibility\n\n| Airflow Version | Support                                        |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| 3.0+            | \u2705 Fully supported                             |\n| 2.x             | \u274c Use `acryl-datahub-airflow-plugin <= 1.6.0` |\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\npip install acryl-datahub-airflow-plugin\n\n# With Kafka emitter\npip install 'acryl-datahub-airflow-plugin[datahub-kafka]'\n```\n\n## Configuration\n\nAdd to `airflow.cfg`:\n\n```ini\n[datahub]\nenabled = True\nconn_id = datahub_rest_default   # Airflow connection pointing to your DataHub GMS\n```\n\nSet up the Airflow connection:\n\n```bash\nairflow connections add datahub_rest_default \\\n  --conn-type HTTP \\\n  --conn-host http://localhost:8080\n```\n\nThe plugin activates automatically \u2014 no changes to your DAG code required.\n\n## Key configuration options\n\n| Option                               | Default | Description                                       |\n| ------------------------------------ | ------- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `enable_extractors`                  | `True`  | Enhance OpenLineage extractors                    |\n| `patch_sql_parser`                   | `True`  | Use DataHub's SQL parser for column-level lineage |\n| `enable_multi_statement_sql_parsing` | `False` | Resolve temp tables across multi-statement tasks  |\n\n## Links\n\n- [Full documentation](https://docs.datahub.com/docs/lineage/airflow)\n- [Apache Airflow](https://airflow.apache.org/)\n- [GitHub](https://github.com/datahub-project/datahub)\n- [Slack community](https://datahub.com/slack)\n", "description_content_type": "text/markdown", "docs_url": null, "download_url": null, "downloads": {"last_day": -1, "last_month": -1, "last_week": -1}, "dynamic": ["Classifier", "Description", "Description-Content-Type", "Home-Page", "License", "Project-Url", "Provides-Extra", "Requires-Dist", "Requires-Python", "Summary"], "home_page": "https://datahub.com/", "keywords": null, "license": "Apache-2.0", "license_expression": null, "license_files": null, "maintainer": null, "maintainer_email": null, "name": "acryl-datahub-airflow-plugin", "package_url": "https://pypi.org/project/acryl-datahub-airflow-plugin/", "platform": null, "project_url": "https://pypi.org/project/acryl-datahub-airflow-plugin/", "project_urls": {"Changelog": "https://github.com/acryldata/datahub/releases", "Documentation": "https://docs.datahub.com/", "Homepage": "https://datahub.com/", "Releases": "https://github.com/acryldata/datahub/releases", "Source": "https://github.com/datahub-project/datahub"}, "provides_extra": ["ignore", "airflow3", "datahub-rest", "datahub-kafka", "datahub-file", "dev", "integration-tests"], "release_url": "https://pypi.org/project/acryl-datahub-airflow-plugin/1.7.0.14/", "requires_dist": ["acryl-datahub[datahub-rest,sql-parser]==1.7.0.14", "pydantic>=2.4.0", "apache-airflow<4.0.0,>=3.0.0", "acryl-datahub[datahub-rest]==1.7.0.14", "apache-airflow-providers-openlineage>=2.1.0", "acryl-datahub[datahub-rest]==1.7.0.14; extra == \"datahub-rest\"", "acryl-datahub[datahub-kafka]==1.7.0.14; extra == \"datahub-kafka\"", "acryl-datahub[sync-file-emitter]==1.7.0.14; extra == \"datahub-file\"", "types-tabulate; extra == \"dev\"", "types-cachetools; extra == \"dev\"", "types-six; extra == \"dev\"", "ruff==0.15.22; extra == \"dev\"", "packaging; extra == \"dev\"", "mypy==1.17.1; extra == \"dev\"", "apache-airflow<4.0.0,>=3.0.0; extra == \"dev\"", "build; extra == \"dev\"", "deepdiff<9.0.0,>=8.6.2; extra == \"dev\"", "tenacity; extra == \"dev\"", "coverage>=5.1; extra == \"dev\"", "pytest-cov>=2.8.1; extra == \"dev\"", "types-setuptools; extra == \"dev\"", "types-click==0.1.12; extra == \"dev\"", "acryl-datahub[datahub-rest,sql-parser]==1.7.0.14; extra == \"dev\"", "types-dataclasses; extra == \"dev\"", "tox; extra == \"dev\"", "twine; extra == \"dev\"", "pydantic>=2.4.0; extra == \"dev\"", "sqlalchemy-stubs; extra == \"dev\"", "types-PyYAML; extra == \"dev\"", "types-toml; extra == \"dev\"", "types-python-dateutil; extra == \"dev\"", "pytest>=6.2.2; extra == \"dev\"", "acryl-datahub[datahub-rest]==1.7.0.14; extra == \"dev\"", "types-requests; extra == \"dev\"", "apache-airflow-providers-openlineage>=2.1.0; extra == \"dev\"", "tox-uv; extra == \"dev\"", "acryl-datahub[datahub-kafka]==1.7.0.14; extra == \"integration-tests\"", "apache-airflow-providers-snowflake; extra == \"integration-tests\"", "virtualenv; extra == \"integration-tests\"", "apache-airflow-providers-google; extra == \"integration-tests\"", "apache-airflow-providers-sqlite; extra == \"integration-tests\"", "apache-airflow-providers-teradata; extra == \"integration-tests\"", "acryl-datahub[testing-utils]==1.7.0.14; extra == \"integration-tests\"", "acryl-datahub[sync-file-emitter]==1.7.0.14; extra == \"integration-tests\"", "snowflake-connector-python>=2.7.10; extra == \"integration-tests\"", "apache-airflow-providers-amazon; extra == \"integration-tests\""], "requires_python": ">=3.10", "summary": "DataHub Airflow plugin \u2014 automatically capture pipeline lineage, run history, and task metadata from Apache Airflow", "version": "1.7.0.14", "yanked": false, "yanked_reason": null}, "releases": {"15.0.4": [{"comment_text": null, "core-metadata": {"sha256": "f512596339dc498a98eb5e5f1c958319ddbf3ccf3aea5218fafc273dfac6b346"}, "digests": {"blake2b_256": "eca8723879abb7f6b8bd6fb58c91a171308f3d5bd49cfb63838d6ad1cd217967", "md5": "34fafef15ffc016f36ac530366383039", "sha256": "339fbf874d0256c35dc46641b52c9639247c3aafeb1961d62fed99e452e4d729"}, "downloads": -1, "filename": "acryl_datahub_airflow_plugin-15.0.4-py3-none-any.whl", "has_sig": false, "md5_digest": "34fafef15ffc016f36ac530366383039", "packagetype": "bdist_wheel", "python_version": "py3", "requires_python": ">=3.8", "size": 48072, "upload_time": "2025-01-23T09:23:39", "upload_time_iso_8601": "2025-01-23T09:23:39.395031Z", "url": "https://files.pythonhosted.org/packages/ec/a8/723879abb7f6b8bd6fb58c91a171308f3d5bd49cfb63838d6ad1cd217967/acryl_datahub_airflow_plugin-15.0.4-py3-none-any.whl", "yanked": true, "yanked_reason": "Wrong version number without 0. in beginning"}, {"comment_text": null, "core-metadata": false, "digests": {"blake2b_256": "963f4839dfc1a2a7e3dc4c22adf0719d0cf9a153724ee87591726c2321b7ecf1", "md5": "bf9d773bc306cbe0cacad86b07e6bd0d", "sha256": "1336290be937e7fd68e11b6a1fc86ea88e0e08e2e200c4cc54225cf8a9fe20a7"}, "downloads": -1, "filename": "acryl_datahub_airflow_plugin-15.0.4.tar.gz", "has_sig": false, "md5_digest": "bf9d773bc306cbe0cacad86b07e6bd0d", "